[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m For a delivered order, return or exchange can be only done once by the agent.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m The agent needs to explain the exchange detail and ask for explicit user confirmation (yes/no) to proceed.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m     - order_id (string, required): The order id, such as '#W0000000'. Be careful there is a '#' symbol at the beginning of the order id.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m     - item_ids (array, required): The item ids to be exchanged, each such as '1008292230'. There could be duplicate items in the list.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m     - new_item_ids (array, required): The item ids to be exchanged for, each such as '1008292230'.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m There could be duplicate items in the list. Each new item id should match the item id
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m in the same position and be of the same product.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m     - payment_method_id (string, required): The payment method id to pay or receive refund for the item price difference,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m such as 'gift_card_0000000' or 'credit_card_0000000'. These can be looked up
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m from the user or order details.
