[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m     - last_name (string, required): The last name of the customer, such as 'Doe'.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m     - zip (string, required): The zip code of the customer, such as '12345'.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2935867)[0m - find_user_id_by_email: Find user id by email. If the user is not found, the function will return an error message.
