[36m(TaskRunner pid=44262)[0m [Observation 11: 'sender='user' message="Well, thank you for all that information! 64GB — that sounds right, I think that's what she wanted. Good to know.\n\nAs for the delivery, I'll have her check with the carrier then. Maybe it got left with a neighbor or something. She's a busy girl, works hard at school, so she might have missed a delivery notice. I'll give her a call after this and let her know the tracking number.\n\nAnd yes, I'd love to go ahead and change my default shipping address to my daughter's address — 943 Maple Drive, Suite 356, Chicago, IL 60621. That would make things so much easier for me. Every time I order something for her, I have to remember to change the address, and half the time I forget and it ends up on my doorstep here in Denver. Then I have to ship it out to her myself, which costs extra. Not ideal, you know?\n\nSo go ahead and make that change whenever you're ready. And thank you for being so helpful — it's nice to have someone to talk to for a bit. Not much excitement around here these days, I'll tell you that much."', Action 11: '{"name": "modify_user_address", "arguments": {"user_id": "lucas_santos_6600", "address1": "943 Maple Drive", "address2": "Suite 356", "city": "Chicago", "state": "IL", "country": "USA", "zip": "60621"}}']
